.0,-4.768370445162873e-07,-1.1920928244535389e-07,-1.1920928244535389e-07,0.0,-8.34461570775602e-06,0.0,-1.1086402082582936e-05,-0.00019333878299221396,-0.45932793617248535,0.0,-0.01682836003601551,-0.3847583830356598,-0.01787400059401989,-0.00882924348115921,-0.25751793384552,-0.6851264238357544,-0.0003293210465926677,-1.9430925021879375e-05,-6.6756979322235566e-06,-1.0609570381348021e-05,-0.0031722483690828085,-2.47952248173533e-05,-6.222531374078244e-05,0.0,-0.00014590153296012431,-3.3378546504536644e-06,-1.7881377516459906e-06,0.0,-1.15061354637146,-0.11840654164552689,-0.0016722993459552526,-0.004505838733166456,-0.017050817608833313,-8.821448318485636e-06,-0.0003116837178822607,0.0,0.0,0.0,-8.344646857949556e-07,-0.00010418349120300263,-7.152555099310121e-07,-3.576278118089249e-07,-0.4090386629104614,-0.001215077005326748,-0.0007068996201269329,-0.0516650564968586,0.0,-6.318072337307967e-06,-5.0424259825376794e-05,-1.0728830375228426e-06,-4.768370445162873e-07,-0.8954905271530151,-0.3494894206523895,0.0,-0.00016783259343355894,-6.031808152329177e-05,-0.00110600795596838,-0.02087736874818802,-7.70062324590981e-05,-0.1177733913064003,-0.07151275128126144,-1.1920928244535389e-07,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0,-7.152555099310121e-07,-0.22777804732322693,-0.00011955977242905647,-0.06530214846134186,0.0,-1.1920928244535389e-07,0.0,0.0,-1.1920928244535389e-07,0.0,-0.006418210454285145,0.0,0.0,-0.06497512012720108,-2.3841830625315197e-06,-6.496695277746767e-05,-1.1920928244535389e-07,0.0,-1.0967194612021558e-05,-0.0006985607906244695,-0.5433346629142761,0.0,-3.0040289857424796e-05,-0.00019631843315437436,0.0,-1.0728830375228426e-06,-1.1920928244535389e-07,0.0,0.0,-0.001209123758599162,-0.0002933310461230576,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0,-7.152555099310121e-07,-1.311301275563892e-06,-2.7418097943154862e-06],"request":{"active_prefix":"","input_ids":[151644,8948,198,2610,525,1207,16948,11,3465,553,54364,14817,13,1446,525,264,10950,17847,13,151645,198,151644,872,198,50,3948,279,3491,3019,553,3019,13,20678,697,1590,4226,304,1124,79075,90,1112,92,382,785,23606,400,87,61,18,488,220,23,87,61,17,481,220,19,87,488,272,284,220,15,3,702,2326,19703,11,825,315,892,374,279,2629,315,279,1008,1378,13,3555,374,400,66,3,30,151645,198,151644,77091,198],"messages":[{"content":"Solve the problem step by step. Give your final answer in \\boxed{...}.\n\nThe equation $x^3 + 8x^2 - 4x + c = 0$ has three roots, one of which is the sum of the other two. What is $c$?","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"5fa7534e02f7c900a7d7aa202cd86fe95cdaf3f22d49c50bc89ae26e00dd4268"},"seconds":26.898262977600098,"seed":624666375128023490,"stop":"eos","text":"Let the roots of the cubic equation \\(x^3 + 8x^2 - 4x + c = 0\\) be \\(r\\), \\(s\\), and \\(t\\), with \\(t = r + s\\). We will use Vieta's formulas, which relate the coefficients of the polynomial to sums and products of its roots.\n\nFrom Vieta's formulas for the equation \\(x^3 + 8x^2 - 4x + c = 0\\), we have:\n1. \\(r + s + t = -8\\)\n2. \\(rs + rt + st = -4\\)\n3. \\(rst = -c\\)\n\nSince \\(t = r + s\\), we substitute \\(t\\) in the first equation:\n\\[r + s + (r + s) = -8\\]\n\\[2(r + s) = -8\\]\n\\[r + s = -4\\]\nThus, \\(t = -4\\).\n\nNext, we substitute \\(t = -4\\) into the second equation:\n\\[rs + r(-4) + s(-4) = -4\\]\n\\[rs - 4r - 4s = -4\\]\nSince \\(r + s = -4\\), we can express \\(s\\) as \\(s = -4 - r\\). Substituting this into the equation, we get:\n\\[rs - 4r - 4(-4 - r) = -4\\]\n\\[rs - 4r + 16 + 4r = -4\\]\n\\[rs + 16 = -4\\]\n\\[rs = -20\\]\n\nFinally, we use the third equation to find \\(c\\):\n\\[rst = -c\\]\n\\[(r)(s)(-4) = -c\\]\n\\[-4rs = -c\\]\n\\[c = 4rs\\]\nSince \\(rs = -20\\), we have:\n\\[c = 4(-20) = -80\\]\n\nThus, the value of \\(c\\) is \\(\\boxed{-80}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{-80}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true,"retains_student_answer":false},"graded_text":"Let the roots of the cubic equation \\(x^3 + 8x^2 - 4x + c = 0\\) be \\(r\\), \\(s\\), and \\(t\\), with \\(t = r + s\\). We will use Vieta's formulas, which relate the coefficients of the polynomial to sums and products of its roots.\n\nFrom Vieta's formulas for the equation \\(x^3 + 8x^2 - 4x + c = 0\\), we have:\n1. \\(r + s + t = -8\\)\n2. \\(rs + rt + st = -4\\)\n3. \\(rst = -c\\)\n\nSince \\(t = r + s\\), we substitute \\(t\\) in the first equation:\n\\[r + s + (r + s) = -8\\]\n\\[2(r + s) = -8\\]\n\\[r + s = -4\\]\nThus, \\(t = -4\\).\n\nNext, we substitute \\(t = -4\\) into the second equation:\n\\[rs + r(-4) + s(-4) = -4\\]\n\\[rs - 4r - 4s = -4\\]\nSince \\(r + s = -4\\), we can express \\(s\\) as \\(s = -4 - r\\). Substituting this into the equation, we get:\n\\[rs - 4r - 4(-4 - r) = -4\\]\n\\[rs - 4r + 16 + 4r = -4\\]\n\\[rs + 16 = -4\\]\n\\[rs = -20\\]\n\nFinally, we use the third equation to find \\(c\\):\n\\[rst = -c\\]\n\\[(r)(s)(-4) = -c\\]\n\\[-4rs = -c\\]\n\\[c = 4rs\\]\nSince \\(rs = -20\\), we have:\n\\[c = 4(-20) = -80\\]\n\nThus, the value of \\(c\\) is \\(\\boxed{-80}\\).","id":"intermediate_algebra:262"}
